                <pb facs="1263" n="1257" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1257"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Willis to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 9.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian" when="1893-12-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#small-caps">December</hi> 5,
                        1893</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In this dispatch Mr. Willis speaks solely of the difficulty experienced in
                    translating; the naval cipher which he is obliged to use and suggests that he be
                    furnished with a simpler code.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
